For more information about Kubernetes versions supported by ACK, see [Kubernetes version release overview](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/185269.html).', example='1.32.1-aliyun.1'),
  loadBalancerId?: string(name='load_balancer_id', description='The Classic Load Balancer (CLB) instance ID used for API Server access. If this parameter is specified, automatic creation of an API Server CLB instance is skipped.
