Default value: `slb.s2.small`.', example='slb.s2.small', deprecated=true),
  loggingType?: string(name='logging_type', description='**[Deprecated]** Enables the log service for the cluster. This parameter takes effect only for ACK Serverless clusters, and the value must be `SLS`.', example='SLS', deprecated=true),
  loginPassword?: string(name='login_password', description='**[Deprecated]** For cluster control plane configuration, use the `login_password` parameter under `control_plane_config` instead. For node pool configuration, use the `login_password` parameter under `scaling_group` in `nodepool` instead.

