This parameter can be set to 0, which indicates no interval between batches.', example='5'),
    maxFailedNodes?: int32(name='max_failed_nodes', description='The maximum number of nodes that are allowed to fail during the rolling update. Default value: 0, which indicates that the task fails if any node fails. If the value is greater than 0, the task fails and stops when the cumulative number of failed nodes exceeds this value.', example='0'),
